            "fr": "AF1234",
            "de": "AF1234",
            "es": "AF1234"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "The airline code and the number, as on the boarding pass: AF1234, KL 1008.",
            "fr": "Le code de la compagnie et le numéro, comme sur la carte d’embarquement : AF1234, KL 1008.",
            "de": "Airline-Code und Nummer, wie auf der Bordkarte: AF1234, KL 1008.",
